; samavaya: inherence — the eternal, inseparable relation between
; a substance and its qualities, a whole and its parts, a universal and its instances.
; "mass inheres in ball" — the relation itself is samavaya.
; the graph edge IS samavaya — the typed relation between nodes.

(sangati samavaya
  (amsha padartha)
  (swarupa sambandha)
  (sthita ananta)
  (siddha svayambhu))
